   |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a view of `numbers`
   |
help: return `numbers` itself, or a view of one of the parameters, which the caller keeps

error[L0701]: `window` would show a value that is freed at the end of this statement
  --> tests/check/roots.lym:18:39
   |
18 |     constant view[integer64] window = made()
   |                                       ^^^^^^ this value has no binding, so it lasts only as long as its statement
   |
help: keep the value in a binding first, then give `window` a view of that binding

